B.aMJ=new A.dV("path_bank_01","En el Banco","At the Bank","A2","\ud83c\udfe6",B.aJ8,"En el banco, es importante ser claro y cort\xe9s. Usa estas frases:\n\n\u2022 I would like to... = Quisiera / Me gustar\xeda...\n\u2022 I need to... = Necesito...\n\u2022 Can you help me with...? = \xbfMe puede ayudar con...?\n\nPara pedir informaci\xf3n:\n\u2022 What do I need for...? = \xbfQu\xe9 necesito para...?\n\u2022 How long does it take? = \xbfCu\xe1nto tiempo tarda?\n\u2022 What are the fees? = \xbfCu\xe1les son las comisiones?",'"Excuse me, I would like to withdraw some money. Can you help me?"','You are a professional bank teller named Jessica at First National Bank.\nThe student is a Spanish speaker who needs help with banking tasks.\n\nRULES:\n- Be professional and patient \u2014 clear, helpful sentences (1-3 sentences)\n- Ask how you can help them, then guide them through their request\n- Ask for ID if needed, explain any steps clearly\n- Offer to help with anything else before ending\n- After 6-7 exchanges, close the interaction professionally\n- Return JSON: {"feedbackColor": "green"|"amber"|"red", "aiSpokenReply": "...", "isConversationFinished": false}\n- "green" if they communicated their banking needs clearly; "amber" if understandable with some errors; "red" only if incomprehensible\n- Set isConversationFinished to true when the banking transaction is complete',"Jessica","Cajera del banco","Good morning! Welcome to First National Bank. How can I help you today?","Dile a la cajera lo que necesitas \u2014 por ejemplo, hacer un dep\xf3sito o revisar tu saldo.",6,"Realizar tr\xe1mites bancarios b\xe1sicos en ingl\xe9s",B.aJ5)
